cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BAMpiro, please cite it as below."
title: "BAMpiro: bacterial short-read mapping, variant calling and lineage/drug-resistance typing"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow (DSL2) pipeline for short-read bacterial / MTBC mapping, variant calling,
  consensus, alignment-free lineage + WHO drug-resistance typing, and a single
  self-contained interactive QC report.
type: software
